// gray.yarn

title: Gray
---
<<if $setting == "motel">>
    <<jump Gray_Motel>>
<<elseif $setting == "breakroom">>
    <<jump Gray_Breakroom>>
<<elseif $setting == "greenroom">>
    <<jump Gray_Greenroom>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Gray_Motel
---
<<if $is_asleep == false && $motel_woke_up == false>>
    Gray: Coroner said this looks like the work of poison.
    You: Poison huh? Interesting method.
    Gray: Yeah, usually woman prefer to kill with poison.
    You: I see... even more interesting.
<<elseif $is_asleep>>
    <<jump Gray_Motel_DuringSleep>>
<<elseif $motel_evidence >= 5>>
    <<jump Gray_Motel_AllEvidence>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Gray_Motel_SomeEvidence>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Gray_Motel_DuringSleep
//setting: motel, gibbs asleep
---
You: ...

Gray: Coroner said this looks like the work of poison.

You: ...

Gray: Okay you're making me uncomfortable now.
===

title: Gray_Motel_SomeEvidence
//setting: motel, gibbs awakened
---
You: I got some evidence here.

Gray: Doubt it's anything I didn't gather myself.

You: Yeah... maybe.
===

title: Gray_Motel_AllEvidence
//setting: motel, gibbs awakened
---
You: I got some evidence here.

Gray: Doubt it's anything I didn't gather myself.

You: Heh, doubt it. I think i've just about cracked this case.

Gray: We'll see about that.
===

title: Gray_Breakroom
---
<<if $gray_breakroom_visited == false>>
    <<set $gray_breakroom_visited = true>>
    <<jump Gray_Breakroom_FirstVisit>>
<<else>>
    // NEEDS DIALOGUE: repeat breakroom Gray interaction
<<endif>>
===

title: Gray_Breakroom_FirstVisit
//setting: breakroom with marty & gray
---
You: You really think I could do lab geek stuff?

Gray: You heard a compliment in all of that?

You: Yeah?

Gray: Jeez, I was meaning to call you a dork Gibbs.
===

title: Gray_Greenroom
---
<<if $is_asleep>>
    <<jump Gray_Greenroom_Asleep>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Gray_Greenroom_Awake>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Gray_Greenroom_Awake
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
Gray: Coroner says this looks like a bludgeoning.

You: Yikes.
===

title: Gray_Greenroom_Asleep
//setting: greenroom with Gray & Bolton, 2nd death
---
Gray: Coroner says this looks like a bludgeoning.

You: ...

Gray: This again? You're freaking me out.
===